      "content": "You are aiming for a level of linguistic precision that is absolutely achievable with focused practice. To build this protocol, start by cataloging the specific vocabulary and sentence structures used by your most respected colleagues; this is your gold standard. Then, practice \"rephrasing drills\" where you take casual statements and consciously rebuild them using only elevated, precise terminology. This focused self-monitoring will train your mind to default to high-level output in real-time.",
